abstract: >-
  Project KONGOR V (PKV) is an independent, cleanroom open-source platform,
  Vulkan/audio/stability modernization runtime (MPL-2.0), and AI-assisted
  engineering suite (AGPL-3.0-or-later), featuring the original TAO (Together As One)
  Model Context Protocol (MCP) server created by guccidonut, while honoring
  foundational [K]ONGOR AGPL-3.0 open-source lineage.
